msgid "Multiwii Serial Protocol (MSP)"
msgstr "Multiwii 串行协议（MSP）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:8
#: d887751d428e4d5084714fb4bbda071b
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports the MSP protocol for telemetry and sensors via any of its"
" serial ports. This allows ArduPilot to send its telemetry data to MSP "
"compatible devices, such as DJI goggles, for On Screen Display (OSD) (See "
":ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2`). It can also be used by external OSDS, "
"such as MWOSD, when setup for MSP protocol (ie betaflight/Inav), instead of "
"MAVLink protocol."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 通过任意串口支持 MSP 协议，用于数传和传感器。这允许 ArduPilot 将其数传数据发送到兼容 MSP 的设备（如 DJI "
"眼镜）进行屏幕显示（OSD）（见 :ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2`）。当配置为 MSP 协议（即 "
"betaflight/Inav）而非 MAVLink 协议时，也可供 MWOSD 等外部 OSD 使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:11
#: d027f67e1b6a405f801861fe9c89e3bb
msgid "Protocol overview"
msgstr "协议概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:13
#: 1c44f3a5dfd046da939511f9c976a9de
msgid ""
"MSP is the main communication protocol used by all Betaflight derived flight"
" stacks. It's a binary message based protocol used for control, telemetry "
"and sensors. ArduPilot's MSP protocol module is ported from Betaflight and "
"iNav, and supports both MSPV1 and MSPV2. It also supports iNav's MSPV2 "
"sensor messages for:"
msgstr ""
"MSP 是所有基于 Betaflight 的飞控固件所使用的主要通信协议。它是一种基于二进制消息的协议，用于控制、数传和传感器数据。ArduPilot "
"的 MSP 协议模块从 Betaflight 和 iNav 移植而来，支持 MSPV1 和 MSPV2，并支持 iNav 的 MSPV2 "
"传感器消息，用于："

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:17
#: 7254dfef82014dda8a0b51c4d5a567dd
msgid "lidar"
msgstr "激光雷达"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:18
#: 0304081c3ed44d63a2eb93d2d6f2a323
msgid "optical flow"
msgstr "光流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:19
#: dda5c47f82e2488fbf36dcbecf7fd4cf
msgid "gps"
msgstr "GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:20
#: 41680708334e48ae88a3d4e6656fe67b
msgid "barometer (future)"
msgstr "气压计（未来支持）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:21
#: fa15dd0c8f2047228325134a18724d1c
msgid "magnetometer (future)"
msgstr "磁力计（未来支持）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:22
#: 5372983917aa4ea88e0197be4b024185
msgid "airspeed (future)"
msgstr "空速计（未来支持）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:24
#: 141795d714db4025b5ed10968c0dbe5e
msgid ""
"At the moment, the ArduPilot implementation supports only telemetry and "
"sensor messages. So currently ArduPilot works with DJI FPV goggles, but "
"can't be controlled by the Betaflight configurator."
msgstr ""
"目前 ArduPilot 的实现仅支持数传和传感器消息。因此 ArduPilot 目前可与 DJI FPV 眼镜配合使用，但不能通过 "
"Betaflight 配置器进行控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:28
#: 998a1329d8964884ac5351e237b8a970
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:30
#: 8d58b4d764184b10adfa1d38b686dd2a
msgid ""
"MSP requires a free serial port, and its speed defaults to 115200 baud. "
"Below SERIAL2 is used for the examples."
msgstr "MSP 需要一个空闲串口，默认速率为 115200 波特。以下示例使用 SERIAL2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:32
#: eda2fd150e984e52af1bb11894a7bf22
msgid "There are 3 MSP backends selected by serial protocol:"
msgstr "有 3 种 MSP 后端，通过串口协议选择："

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:34
#: 8ad8b43d96f2453ca44f381f9829b01a
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 33 is for DJI FPV or RE Goggles"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 33 用于 DJI FPV 或 RE 眼镜"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:35
#: f29366358af344568b4e7e610376717e
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 32 is for sensors or generic MSP"
" telemetry usage"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 32 用于传感器或通用 MSP 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:36
#: 05c08478ec0f41e4b52c6f76f5620771
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 42 is for DisplayPort for DJI "
"goggle using wtf-os firmare, HDZero, Walksnail, or DisplayPort MWOSD."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 42 用于使用 wtf-os 固件的 DJI 眼镜 "
"DisplayPort、HDZero、Walksnail 或 DisplayPort MWOSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:38
#: 6ba6561e58284a95b10f2ab20d72f8f5
msgid ""
"There are 2 different DJI telemetery protocols to try to maintain "
"compatibility with DJI's evolving hardware."
msgstr "有 2 种不同的 DJI 数传协议，以尽量保持与 DJI 不断演进的硬件的兼容性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:40
#: f6aedaae388b42e99fdae5b8a490eff2
msgid ""
"When :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 33 is selected the protocol"
" decoder can work in polling mode (default) or in \"telemetry push\" mode. "
"When working in polling mode, both TX and RX must be connected to the MSP "
"telemetry transceiver. While in push mode only the TX line is used. To "
"enable push mode, simply set :ref:`MSP_OPTIONS<MSP_OPTIONS>` bit 0 to \"1\";"
" to disable set it to \"0\" (default)."
msgstr ""
"当选择 :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 33 "
"时，协议解码器可以以轮询模式（默认）或「数传推送」模式工作。在轮询模式下，TX 和 RX 都必须连接到 MSP 数传收发器。而在推送模式下只使用 TX "
"线。要启用推送模式，将 :ref:`MSP_OPTIONS<MSP_OPTIONS>` 第 0 位设为「1」；禁用则设为「0」（默认）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-overview.rst:42
#: 873c3af973e540c9bcde149f3fd3bcb2
msgid ""
"MSP sensors such as the Matek 3901-L0X are supported by both protocols."
msgstr "两种协议均支持 MSP 传感器，例如 Matek 3901-L0X。"
